  "commentary": [
    {
      "t": 0,
      "text": "All square in the final, and Zidane has just sent on Gareth Bale."
    },
    {
      "t": 2.2,
      "text": "Madrid keeping the ball, moving Liverpool around."
    },
    {
      "t": 5.4,
      "text": "Marcelo in space on the left…"
    },
    {
      "t": 7,
      "text": "Here's the cross, looking for Bale…"
    },
    {
      "t": 8.2,
      "text": "Bale's gone for the spectacular!"
    },
    {
      "t": 8.75,
      "text": "WHAT A GOAL! An overhead kick in a Champions League final!"
    },
    {
      "t": 10,
      "text": "A couple of minutes off the bench, and Bale produces a masterpiece."
